<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan to auction federal investment bonds.</title>
<headline>Pakistan to auction federal investment bonds.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Wednesday it had invited bids for the auction of three-, five- and 10-year federal investment bonds.</p>
<p>Bids must be submitted by Saturday. The result will be announced on Sunday with settlement on Monday, the bank said.</p>
<p>In the previous auction on November 25, the bank accepted bids worth 100.003 million rupees at par for three-year bonds and 434.526 million rupees at par for 10-year bonds. No bids were received for the five-year bonds.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
